  "description": "Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection integration for Scrubkit. Call services.AddScrubkit(...) to register a configured FolderScrubber for constructor injection in ASP.NET Core, worker services, and other generic hosts. Configure recursion, limits, add-on extractors, and an optional redactor via the ReadOptions hook.",
